# Weighing the Evidence: Legal Discourse in the 19th-Century Spanish Feminist Concepcion Arenal.

**Authors:** Irizarry, Estelle

## Abstract
Utilizes a computer program to search for legal terminology in Concepcion Arenal's 1861 treatise &quot;The Woman of the Future.&quot; Arenal appropriated two different types of legal discourse in her work. Discusses the problems this presented for linguistic analyses. Includes fascinating details on Arenal and her work. (MJP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ523742

